Z||000000||BAM-BAM||06-18-2001||10:26 PM|||| I sur wish there was a better smilie to represent the way I feel right now. This is, to those of you besides myself who ordered Aus's sub console,AWESOME!!! Man Aus, you did one hell of a job. And, you even sent mine (unassembled) in the box that some of  your joinery tools came in, how cool is that. He also sent me a copy of one of the Australian motor mags "Unique Cars". Man it's like a whole different world over there. They have cars that I have never heard of and they are awesome, even the Japanese cars ar cool.<BR>  Anyway, back to the sub console. This is a true work of craftsmanship. Aus, you really out did yourself on this. If this is the quality that I can expect in the Stage-2 kit, them consider me your first customer. This thing went together in about 15 minutes (no upholstery yet) But every hole was perfectly aligned and every seem was perfectly true. This is really the best value I have gotten for my Fiero. <BR>  Great work Aus, keep the "Quality" ideas coming. Oh by the way, your server still says your mail is dead. Cudo's<P>Peace, A Very Happy B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!||||reg||10
