Z||000004||BAM-BAM||06-19-2001||12:02 AM||||  No the Sub box doesn't come upholstered, that way you can match it your car. I have Mr. Mikes leather and it's not the stock gray. His craftsmanship is top notch. I have assembled alot of RTA furnature and this is as good as the best. Better, considering it was done in his garage.<BR>  Haze, as for the magazine, it pretty cool. Alot of cars that I have never seen. Manufactures are familiar, but the models are deffinitely different. The have some real american looking Nissans. The prices are what kills me. A Trans-Am GTA convertable goes for around $117,000.00 in Aus. Yet a Porsche 911 Targa goes for around $65,000.00, go figure. <BR>  Aus did real good on this one and I have faith in his quality control. So, when Stage-2 is ready, It's mine. Can't say enough good things.<P>Peace, B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||12
